  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Mumbai: <a href=\"/tag/max+lab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Max Lab</a> has expanded its presence in <a href=\"/tag/haryana\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Haryana</a> as it opened a new <a href=\"/tag/diagnostic+laboratory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">diagnostic laboratory</a> in <a href=\"/tag/panipat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Panipat</a>.The new laboratory aims to address the growing demand for reliable and <a href=\"/tag/advanced+diagnostic+services\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">advanced diagnostic services</a> in Tier II cities, Max Lab said.The new facility is equipped with advanced diagnostic technology and will offer a wide spectrum of tests, ranging from routine pathology investigations to specialised diagnostics, including advanced genomics and oncology testing.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Arpan Malhotra, Director and COO, Max Lab, said, “The expansion of our diagnostic network in Panipat is an important step towards enhancing access to reliable and advanced diagnostic services in the region. Diagnostics play a critical role in clinical decision-making, influencing the course of treatment and enabling timely intervention.”</p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                